  "kind": "definition",
  "title": "Covers of a functor",
  "statement": "Let $F:(\\mathit{Sch})^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\textit{Sets}$ be a functor and\nlet $(H_i)_{i\\in I}$ be a family of\nsubfunctors of $F$. The family\n*covers* $F$ if for every $\\xi\\in F(T)$ there is an open covering\n$T=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}U_i$ with $\\xi|_{U_i}\\in H_i(U_i)$ (Schemes,\nDefinition 26.15.3, Tag\n[01JI](https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/01JI)).",
